---
import PageSection from "./PageSection.astro";
---

<PageSection id="about" eyebrow="About" title="Business and technology professional at the intersection of engineering and product with a love for collaborating with others who are passionate and optimistic in today's age.">
  <figure class="max-w-3xl border-l-2 border-primary py-1 pl-6 md:pl-8">
    <blockquote class="font-display text-xl font-medium italic leading-snug text-ink md:text-2xl">
      “Curiosity is the engine of achievement.”
    </blockquote>
    <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">— Ken Robinson</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <div class="grid stack-grid md:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-line bg-paper p-6 md:p-8">
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-lg font-medium text-muted">What I am <span class="text-primary">not</span></h3>
      <p class="leading-7 text-ink">
        A child genius who shipped an operating system at three and graduated from Harvard at fifteen with a thesis on saving the world. Native spoken language is binary, can barely hold eye contact and couldn't hold a conversation with a wall for 5 miniutes.<br/> <br/>(Leaving that typo in because I did indeed write this myself and didn't use AI for <i>everything</i>, I still use my brain).
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(17,17,17,0.06)] md:p-8">
      <h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">What I <span class="italic text-primary">am</span></h3>
      <p class="leading-7 text-ink">
        Someone who feeds off being productive and fueled by momentum, genuinely curious—I like becoming multifaceted enough to take on whatever the work demands once I lock in. I love talking product and business in a world full of problems worth solving, and figuring out how to fill the gaps.<br/><br/>I'd empathise with a wall and probably do something for it.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</PageSection>